# Vantage Admin Project Organization

`vantage-admin` is the Next.js 16 App Router owner/admin dashboard. Preserve ownership boundaries; put new work in the folder that owns the behavior.

**Planned (not shipped):** an Owner Daily View / owner-home UX change is intended on branch `granot-lead-lifecycle`. It is **not architected** and has **no implementation**. Live `/` remains `HomeOverview` (analytics overview + quick links). Do not invent routes, components, query keys, or KPIs, and do not treat `uxdocs/admin-operational-views-ux-proposal.md` as current product. See `uxdocs/owner-daily-view-planned.txt`.

